<Project>
  <!-- This originally forced OutputPath/IntermediateOutputPath directly to keep two sibling
       .csproj files (an old, since-deleted duplicate project) from sharing the same obj/bin
       intermediate folder. Only one project remains now, so that's no longer needed; and
       overriding OutputPath/IntermediateOutputPath directly (instead of the Base* versions)
       bypasses the SDK's own Configuration/TargetFramework/RuntimeIdentifier-aware path
       composition, which the WPF markup compiler and ArcGIS Pro SDK targets rely on. Left empty
       (rather than deleted) in case another project is ever added to this folder and the same
       sharing problem needs solving again; use Base*OutputPath, not OutputPath/IntermediateOutputPath,
       if so. -->
</Project>
